{"change_summary":"Clarified the habitat/geometry biofilter probe’s fallback reporting in `crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_habitat_geometry_probes.rs`. When neither media arm clears reduced nitrogen inside the 28-day horizon, the detailed debug line now marks reduced-N exposure as non-gating fallback context, and the aggregate probe summary now emphasizes the actual pass criteria for that path: higher nitrifier biomass plus lower terminal TAN/NO2/reduced-N, rather than foregrounding exposure values that are not used to decide the result.","outstanding_risks":["The biofilter scenario still reaches the terminal reduced-N fallback path in the current calibration; this pass improved the reporting but did not retune the scenario to demonstrate literal earlier clearance within the 28-day horizon.","Validation was targeted to the affected habitat/geometry probe target plus clippy, not the full workspace test matrix.","The worktree still contains unrelated pre-existing changes in `.claude/worktrees/tanksim-6e5.4.7` and `.ralph-burning/`; I left them untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Updated the biofilter probe’s fallback-path reporting so non-clearing runs explicitly label reduced-N exposure as diagnostic-only context and surface nitrifier biomass alongside the terminal chemistry metrics that actually gate the pass result.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Reformatted the workspace and reran the habitat/geometry summary probe to verify the revised fallback output still leaves all five probes passing.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Reran clippy on the affected habitat/geometry test target and adjusted the implementation to keep the reporting change warning-clean under `-D warnings`.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes all_habitat_geometry_probes_summary -- --nocapture` passed: the summary runner was green and reported all 5 habitat/geometry probes passing.","The updated biofilter diagnostics now print `reduced-N exposure ... (non-gating fallback context)` in the detailed metrics line, and the aggregate summary now reports `nitrifier biomass ... final reduced-N ... clearance not-cleared->not-cleared (terminal reduced-N fallback)` for the fallback case.","`cargo clippy -p tank_harness --test e2e_habitat_geometry_probes -- -D warnings` completed successfully."]}